            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{
                      "Hiring a pure ISO consultant who ignores your SOC 2."
                    }</strong
                  >{
                    " They'll rebuild policies from templates they own, rewrite risk registers in their format, and quote you for a \"full ISMS implementation\" as if you've never done compliance. You'll pay for work you already did."
                  }</span
